{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"乘法群概形"},0],"subject":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"代数几何","text":"代数几何"}}]},4],"title":[{"Plain":"乘法群概形"},2],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},5],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<h3>内语言</h3>\n<p>用 "},{"Local":{"url":"Zariski意象","text":"Zariski 意象"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathsf{Sh}(\\mathsf{Aff}_{\\mathrm{Zar}})$ 的"},{"Local":{"url":"意象的内语言","text":"内语言"}},{"Plain":",\n$$\r\n\\mathbb G_m = \\{x\\in \\mathbb A^1\\mid \\exists y\\in\\mathbb A^1, xy=1\\}.\r\n$$</p>\n<h3>作为仿射概形</h3>\n<p>$\\mathbb G_m$ 是"},{"Local":{"url":"仿射概形","text":"仿射概形"}},{"Plain":" $\\operatorname{Spec}\\mathbb{Z}[x^{\\pm 1}]$.</p>\n<h2>性质</h2>\n<h3>群作用</h3>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>. "},{"Local":{"url":"仿射概形","text":"仿射概形"}},{"Plain":" $\\operatorname{Spec} A$ 上的 $\\mathbb G_m$-作用相当于 $A$ 上的一个 $\\mathbb{Z}$-"},{"Local":{"url":"分次代数","text":"分次"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p>见"},{"Local":{"url":"fil-gr","text":"滤与分次的叠观点"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}